<V2Layout seo={getSeo("/jackets-manufacturer/")} navCurrent={["/production/", "/jackets-manufacturer/"]}>
<header class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero__main">
      <p class="hero__eyebrow">B2B / OEM-ODM / PRIVATE LABEL</p>
      <h1 class="section-h1 hero__h1">Custom Jacket Manufacturer for Private Label Brands</h1>
      <p class="hero__lead">Private label jacket programs depend on decisions a catalog cannot settle: season, use case, silhouette, shell, lining, insulation, closures, and brand finishing. This page explains how a jacket brief moves from product definition through material and construction review, sampling, revision, and approval, and how quality checks, packing rules, and testing requirements are set before bulk production. Quantities, pricing, sampling time, and delivery schedules are confirmed project by project, because jacket construction varies more widely than most garment categories.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__media">
      <figure>
        <img src="/uploads/jackets-manufacturer/hero-jackets-private-label.webp" alt="Private label jacket produced as a finished-garment reference" width="1536" height="1024" loading="eager" />
      </figure><p class="hero__cap"><b>Product direction</b>Visual reference image · final specifications require confirmation</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="indexbar" aria-label="Section index">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="indexbar__list">
      <a class="indexbar__item" href="#jk-types">Types</a>
